{"chapter": "sets", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "000Z", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{A}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{A}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\{A_s\\}_{s\\in S}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{A}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{A}' \\subset \\mathcal{A}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{A}' \\to \\mathcal{A}$", "MATH_0007": "$\\Ob(\\mathcal{A}')$", "MATH_0008": "$\\Ob(\\mathcal{A}')$", "MATH_0009": "$A_s$", "MATH_0010": "$s \\in S$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{A}'$", "MATH_0012": "$\\mathcal{A}'$", "MATH_0013": "$\\mathcal{A}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{categories-remark-big-categories}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{homology-definition-abelian-category}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{homology-definition-enough-injectives}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\item", "STRUCT_0006": "\\item", "STRUCT_0007": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-abelian-injectives}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:daf62755a4728ff5b4580a1ae405028ef5227ff535d585fb565d8bf6574db2ef", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a122c472ae3df929e1d56366eb616eaac4d3c87b292981e8e689009e2ab6db58", "source_text": "Suppose given a big category <MATH_0001> (see\nCategories, Remark <REF_0001>).\nAssume <MATH_0002> is abelian and has enough injectives.\nSee Homology, Definitions <REF_0002>\nand <REF_0003>.\nThen for any given set of objects <MATH_0003>\nof <MATH_0004>, there is an abelian subcategory\n<MATH_0005>\nwith the following properties:\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> the inclusion functor <MATH_0006> is exact,\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0007> is a set,\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0008> contains <MATH_0009> for each <MATH_0010>,\n<STRUCT_0005> <MATH_0011> has enough injectives, and\n<STRUCT_0006> an object of <MATH_0012> is injective if and only if it\nis an injective object of <MATH_0013>.\n<STRUCT_0007>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a9672851c2868b344573b3b125e22e4af7a944cd18dd133d104f98b887277992", "unit_id": "tag:0010:statement"}
